      {
        "text": "Donna Tryfman is a deputy public defender in Los Angeles County. She joined the office in 1998, has tried over 100 jury trials, and handles homicide cases in the major cases unit. She supervised Eastlake Juvenile Court and represented clients in collaborative drug court. She served as a judge pro tem in traffic and small claims cases. She was president of the California Public Defenders Association for five years.",
